k into he and his daughters' life, but as the Japanese feudal system unravels, Seibei is still bound by the code of honor of the samurai and by his own sense of social precedence. How can he find a way to do what is best for those he loves?"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"幕末の庄内地方。海坂藩の御蔵役を務める井口清兵衛は、夕方に仕事を終えると同僚の酒の誘いも断り真っ直ぐ自宅に帰り、家事と内職にいそしんでいた。認知症を抱える老母と幼い2人の娘の世話、そして労咳で死んだ妻の薬代や葬儀などで嵩んだ借金を返済するためだ。日々の暮らしに追われ、次第に身なりが薄汚れていく清兵衛。同僚の中には、そんな彼を陰で「たそがれ清兵衛」と呼んで小馬鹿にする者もいた。  春、清兵衛は親友の飯沼倫之丞と再会する。倫之丞は妹の朋江が酒乱の夫・甲田豊太郎に度々暴力を振るわれるため、離縁させたことを清兵衛にうちあける。","tagline":"そんな父のことを、私は誇りに思っております―"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hdM5abIbokQGPr1qtr7Feywppyc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pNpQf1ZwdKLHo25jFSDisMfqXJl.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}},"tmdb:inventory-v2:series":{"originalLanguage":"ja-JP","images":{"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hdM5abIbokQGPr1qtr7Feywppyc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hdM5abIbokQGPr1qtr7Feywppyc.jpg","language":"ja","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bB2M8UF8wc9flfGWkcgkTTf8Mzr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bB2M8UF8wc9flfGWkcgkTTf8Mzr.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7uMbrbP7GXvO65yw4SjONyINdfa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7uMbrbP7GXvO65yw4SjONyINdfa.jpg","language":"ja","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m904GdHM22vZNDlEFYJsIuPY1Nd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m904GdHM22vZNDlEFYJsIuPY1Nd.jpg","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jrf985NC2yKMjqxpe7aE3iVtAlF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jrf985NC2yKMjqxpe7aE3iVtAlF.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https: